پروگرامما ئەسلەك-باشقۇرۇش: 4.

>> Doubler := ئوبيېكت يېڭى.
>> Multiplier := ئوبيېكت يېڭى.
Doubler كەلگەندە: ⌝'double:and:'⌜ قىل: ⎬ :x :y
	>> q := x + 1. <- ﴿﴿x × 2﴾ + ﴿y × 2﴾﴾.
⎨.

Multiplier كەلگەندە: ⌝'multiply:and:'⌜ قىل: ⎬ :x :y <- ﴿x × y﴾.
⎨.

چىقىرىش ياز: ﴿
	Doubler double:
		﴿Doubler double: 
			﴿Multiplier multiply: 2 and: 3﴾
		and:
			﴿Multiplier multiply: 3 and: 4﴾
		﴾
	and:
		﴿Doubler double: 
			﴿Multiplier multiply: 2 and: 3﴾
		and:
			﴿Multiplier multiply: 3 and: 4﴾
		﴾
﴾, يېڭى-قۇر.
